# Package marker for the shared Bazel infrastructure library.
#
# This package deliberately contains NO application source. It only provides
# reusable Starlark helpers, macros, platforms, constraints, aspects, and CI
# glue consumed by language packages across the monorepo.
#
# Subpackages:
#   bazel/defs/          pure helper functions and per-language constants
#   bazel/macros/        *_app() wrappers that keep BUILD files declarative
#   bazel/toolchains/    select() helpers for toolchain resolution
#   bazel/platforms/     host + target platform definitions
#   bazel/constraints/   os/arch constraint settings and values
#   bazel/config/        build-affecting config flags + config_settings
#   bazel/aspects/       lint + coverage aspects (wired to real tooling)
#   bazel/transitions/   configuration transitions (e.g. platform forcing)
#   bazel/extensions/    SCAFFOLD module extensions — placeholders
#   bazel/bzlmod/        override helper structs consumed by MODULE.bazel
#   bazel/ci/            thin shell sh_test wrappers around bazel + pre-commit
